# Lloyds Banking Group Work Experience Programme

**Personal Work Experience Summary**

This document summarises my participation in the Lloyds Banking Group Work Experience Programme.

**Company:** Lloyds Banking Group
**Programme:** S5 Work Experience Programme
**Location:** Teviot House, Edinburgh
