- Explored careers in Finance, Technology, Human Resources, Marketing, Risk, Audit and Customer Services.
- Took part in teamwork and case study activities.
- Developed presentation and public speaking skills.
- Participated in problem-solving and creative thinking exercises.
- Learned techniques for CV writing, job applications and interviews.
- Worked with other students to prepare and deliver presentations.
- Networked with Lloyds Banking Group employees and gained insight into professional careers.

